    "description": "Crompton Greaves Advisory Limited is actively seeking a talented and motivated Quality Control Engineer to join our dynamic team in Raipur. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Crompton Greaves Advisory Limited:\nCrompton Greaves Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Maintain accurate production records and prepare daily reports\n• Prepare production cost analysis and efficiency reports\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in APQP\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in 5S\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Learning & development budget\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Raipur, Chhattisgarh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Crompton Greaves Advisory Limited!",
